# WP21-PLAY (Near): editor Play expands every prefab instance as the cook does (ExpandPrefabInstances), so the
# instance WP21_Span (4 cubes 1500 cm apart) streams as 4 records in 4 cells and the saved HLODs stand in for
# each one. Compare with the Runtime frame of the cooked world (WP21 p10, frames/runtime/wp21_near.png).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP21_PrefabSpan_Near.desce
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Когда run Scene "Build HLODs"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда play_near 4 куба мешами (ячейки загружены), как кадр Runtime near; в журнале «1 prefab instance(s) expanded into», без дыр HLOD
Когда run Action "Stop"
